@game_matcher_HostAddress = http://localhost:5171

### Public roster and ratings
GET {{game_matcher_HostAddress}}/api/players
Accept: application/json

### Public games, teams and results
GET {{game_matcher_HostAddress}}/api/events/history
Accept: application/json

### Session and anti-forgery token (use the browser frontend for organizer writes)
GET {{game_matcher_HostAddress}}/api/auth/session
Accept: application/json
